  "type": "biological",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Neotenics are transhumans modified to retain a child-like form. They are smaller, more agile, inquisitive, and less resource-depleting, making them ideal for habitat living and spacecraft. Some people find neotenic sleeves distasteful, especially when employed in certain media and sex work capacities, but most are designed to be neuter-gendered.</p>",
    "reference": "Eclipse Phase Second Edition p. 55",
